# Architecture Documentation

## System Overview

The Supply Chain Optimization Dashboard is a modern, three-tier web application architecture consisting of a frontend presentation layer, a backend API layer, and a data persistence layer. This document provides a comprehensive overview of the system's design, components, and interactions.

